  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grant-Light Zambia 100% Operational Pilot Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Light Zambia &#x2013; 100% project pilots a Solar Home Systems Energy-as-a-Service (SHS- EaaS) model in rural Zambia, providing 250 households in a targeted community with affordable, reliable solar energy. The project aims to test and demonstrate the feasibility of the Solar Home Systems- Energy-as-a-Service (SHS-EaaS) model in Zambia as a pathway to universal, long-term energy access for the hardest-to-reach communities.</narrative>
  </description>
